0	section	Talking to Edmond after getting the gas mask
1	line	Player	Hi Edmond, I've got the gas mask now.
1	line	Edmond	Good stuff, now for the digging. Beneath us are the Ardougne sewers. I've done some research, and I reckon you can use them to enter West Ardougne.
1	line	Edmond	I've already tried digging down to them but the soil is rock hard. You'll need to pour on several buckets of water to soften it up. I reckon four buckets should do it.
1	action	end
