0	section	Talking to Men and Women in West Ardougne
0	section	Woman (variant 1)id=1130,1142
1	line	Player	Hello, how's it going?
1	line	Woman	Bah, those mourners... they're meant to be helping us, but I think they're doing more harm here than good. They won't even let me send a letter out to my family.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Have you seen a lady called Elena around here?
2	line	Player	Have you seen a lady called Elena around here?
2	line	Woman	Yes, I've seen her. Very helpful person.
2	line	Woman	Not for the last few days though... I thought maybe she'd gone home.
2	action	end
1	option	You should stand up to them more.
2	line	Player	You should stand up to them more.
2	line	Woman	Oh I'm not one to cause a fuss.
2	action	end
0	section	Woman (variant 2)id=1139
1	line	Player	Hello, how's it going?
1	line	Woman	Life is tough.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Yes, living in a plague city must be hard.
2	line	Player	Yes, living in a plague city must be hard.
2	line	Woman	Plague? Pah, that's no excuse for the treatment we've received. It's obvious pretty quickly if someone has the plague.
2	line	Woman	I'm thinking about making a break for it. I'm perfectly healthy, not gonna infect anyone.
2	action	end
1	option	I'm sorry to hear that.
2	line	Player	I'm sorry to hear that.
2	line	Woman	Well, ain't much either you or me can do about it.
2	action	end
1	option	I'm looking for a lady called Elena.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a lady called Elena.
2	line	Woman	I've not heard of her. Old Jethick knows a lot of people, maybe he'll know where you can find her.
2	action	end
1	line	Player	Good day.
1	line	Woman	We don't have good days here anymore. Curse King Tyras.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Oh okay, bad day then.
2	line	Player	Oh okay, bad day then.
2	action	end
1	option	Why, what has he done?
2	line	Player	Why, what has he done?
2	line	Woman	His army curses our city with this plague then wanders off again, leaving us to clear up the pieces.
2	action	end
1	option	I'm looking for a woman called Elena.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a woman called Elena.
2	line	Woman	Not heard of her.
2	action	end
