0	section	Talking to Mourner or Head Mourner in West Ardougne
1	line	Mourner	Hmmm, how did you get over here? You're not one of this rabble. Ah well, you'll have to stay. Can't risk you going back now.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	So what's a mourner?
2	line	Player	So what's a mourner?
2	line	Mourner	We're working for King Lathas of East Ardougne. He has tasked us with containing the accursed plague sweeping West Ardougne.
2	line	Mourner	We also do our best to ease these people's suffering. We're nicknamed mourners because we spend a lot of time at plague victim funerals, no one else is allowed to risk attending.
2	line	Mourner	It's a demanding job, and we get little thanks from the people here.
2	action	end
1	option	I haven't got the plague though...
2	line	Player	I haven't got the plague though...
2	line	Mourner	Can't risk you being a carrier. That protective clothing you have isn't regulation issue. It won't meet safety standards.
2	action	end
1	option	I'm looking for a woman named Elena.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a woman named Elena.
2	line	Mourner	Ah yes, I've heard of her. A healer I believe. She must be mad coming over here voluntarily.
2	line	Mourner	I hear rumours she has probably caught the plague now. Very tragic, a stupid waste of life.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ted Rehnison before getting the book from Jethick
1	line	Ted Rehnison	Go away. We don't want any.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Jethick if the player does not have Elena's picture
1	line	Jethick	Hello, I don't recognise you. We don't get many newcomers around here.
1	line	Player	How come?
1	line	Jethick	The plague of course. Not many people want to come to a place like this and the few that do normally get stopped by the mourners.
1	line	Jethick	All you'll find here now are the dead and the dying. Even our own king has abandoned us.
1	line	Player	Your king?
1	line	Jethick	Yes, King Tyras of West Ardougne. He's the brother of King Lathas, the ruler of East Ardougne.
1	line	Player	So where is the king?
1	line	Jethick	Well he's always been a bit of an explorer. He's led multiple expeditions into the uncharted lands to the west.
1	line	Jethick	The plague first started when he came back from one of these expeditions. More than a few suspect that some of his men caught it out there and brought it back with them.
1	line	Jethick	The king didn't care though. He just left on another expedition to the west. He hasn't been seen since. He left the city warder Bravek in charge but he's no better.
1	line	Jethick	Anyway, you clearly didn't come here to talk about kings. So tell me, what brings you to West Ardougne?
1	line	Player	I'm looking for a woman from East Ardougne called Elena.
1	line	Jethick	East Ardougnian women are easier to find in East Ardougne. Not many would come to West Ardougne to find one. Although the name is familiar, what does she look like?
1	line	Player	Um... brown hair... in her twenties...
1	line	Jethick	Hmmm, that doesn't narrow it down a huge amount... I'll need to know more than that, or see a picture?
1	action	end
